RUN | $T/game/ops/+x/var_math.+x | $T/game | set | pos_2_3 | 11
RUN | $T/game/ops/+x/var_math.+x | $T/game | set | dice_counter | 2
RUN | $T/game/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x | $T/game | $T | --trigger | attack | --state | $T/game
