EXPECT_HAS | game/variables.txt | \nhp_2_3=5\n | attacker-1+0-vs-3-lost-but-the-re-roll-6-wins
EXPECT_HAS | game/variables.txt | \nrr_1_1=1\n | re-roll-flag-set
