EXPECT_HAS | game/ledger.txt | COMBAT\p | a-fight-happened
EXPECT_HAS | game/ledger.txt | CAST\p | abilities-were-cast
RUN | /usr/bin/sha256sum | game/variables.txt | game/switches.txt | game/ledger.txt | game/dice_ledger.txt | game/rand_ledger.txt | game/audit_ledger.txt
CAPTURE | sig_a
CLEAN | 
